## 📂 Featured Projects & Repositories

### 1. [Migraine Clinical EDA & Machine Learning](https://github.com/ananyaja/migraine-clinical-eda-ml)
- **Description:** An end-to-end clinical data science pipeline analyzing neurological migraine patterns. Includes SQL data wrangling, advanced exploratory data analysis (EDA) with clinical storytelling, and machine learning classification models.
- **Key Tools:** Python, Pandas, Seaborn, Scikit-Learn, SQL

### 2. [Calculus & Optimization in Python](https://github.com/ananyaja/calculus-and-optimization-python)
- **Description:** A structured Python repository exploring calculus, optimization, and numerical methods for Data Science and Machine Learning. Features from-scratch implementations of gradient descent surface plots and numerical integration visualizers.
- **Key Tools:** Python, NumPy, SciPy, Matplotlib

### 3. [Battery E-Waste Lifecycle Tracker](https://github.com/ananyaja/battery-ewaste-lifecycle-tracker)
- **Description:** A Python toolkit and educational repository for battery inventory logging, e-waste triage, and circular economy tracking, featuring automated environmental impact plots.
- **Key Tools:** Python, Pandas, Matplotlib

### 4. [Linux System Inspection & Automation](https://github.com/ananyaja/linux-system-inspection-and-automation)
- **Description:** A collection of Python and Linux command-line utilities and Jupyter notebooks focused on system inspection, environment automation, and data processing workflows.
- **Key Tools:** Python, Bash, Linux Terminal

